    "title": "CHET SNYDER APPEARS IN WAYNE COUNTY CIRCUIT COURT TUESDAY - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mark Wells ,\n11 hours ago Former Frontier Community College Head Volleyball Coach, 51-year-old Chet Snyder appeared in Wayne County Circuit Court Tuesday morning on multiple criminal charges, including sexual abuse involving two male victims. Snyder appeared in court with his attorney, Troy Parrish, before Judge Denton Aud. Court records indicate the state has complied with discovery in the case. A By Agreement status conference is set for a pretrial hearing on February 17, 2026, at 11 a.m. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
